WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.666
Froakie, use Water Pulse, let's go.

2
00:00:06.733 --> 00:00:09.566
Kie! Froakie!

3
00:00:10.966 --> 00:00:12.833
- Yeah. That was great.
- Froakie.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.200
Next up, it's you, Pikachu. Thunderbolt, let's go.

5
00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:19.433
Pika, Pikachu!

6
00:00:20.633 --> 00:00:23.566
- Pi!
- All right!

7
00:00:23.633 --> 00:00:26.900
Pikachu and Froakie are really fired up, aren't they?

8
00:00:26.966 --> 00:00:29.833
- Everyone's in sync.
- Keep it up. You look great.

9
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.833
Denne. Denne-ne!

10
00:00:36.566 --> 00:00:38.366
Look. Something's floating this way.

11
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.966
- It's Sanpei.
- Pikachu.

12
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.566
Sanpei!

13
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.433
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

14
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.333
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

15
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.566
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

16
00:00:56.633 --> 00:00:58.800
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

17
00:00:58.866 --> 00:01:01.366
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

18
00:01:01.433 --> 00:01:05.266
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

19
00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:08.766
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

20
00:01:08.833 --> 00:01:12.733
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

21
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.366
♪ The future of the world is in your hand ♪

22
00:01:17.433 --> 00:01:19.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

23
00:01:23.733 --> 00:01:26.333
A Stealthy Challenge!

24
00:01:29.233 --> 00:01:32.166
- Wake up. Sanpei.
- Pikachu.

25
00:01:32.233 --> 00:01:34.966
As our heroes continue to Coumarine City,

26
00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:38.466
they've reunited with their friend Sanpei, the boy ninja.

27
00:01:38.533 --> 00:01:40.833
But something's not right.

28
00:01:42.433 --> 00:01:44.066
-Yay. He's awake.

29
00:01:44.866 --> 00:01:48.900
You're Ash. That's right. Huh, where's Greninja?

30
00:01:48.966 --> 00:01:51.133
- Hey, don't worry. Look behind you.
- Huh?

31
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.533
Clemont just gave it a Pecha Berry.

32
00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:57.166
That cured Greninja's poisoning. It should feel better in no time.

33
00:01:57.233 --> 00:01:59.233
Greninja.

34
00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.966
Well, thank goodness for that. Hm. Thanks, Ash.

35
00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:07.266
You too, Bonnie, Serena and Clemont. You saved us.

36
00:02:07.333 --> 00:02:09.666
- I'm so grateful.
- No prob.

37
00:02:09.733 --> 00:02:12.400
Wow, it's been a long time since I've seen you guys.

38
00:02:12.466 --> 00:02:14.333
- So is everybody doing well?
- Yeah.

39
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.266
- Uh-huh.
- Yup.

40
00:02:16.333 --> 00:02:18.233
Sanpei, is that Pokémon...

41
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:23.900
Greninja. The Ninja Pokémon, and the evolved form of Frogadier.

42
00:02:23.966 --> 00:02:26.433
Greninja's swift movements confound its opponents,

43
00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.500
and it can compress water into sharp-edged throwing stars.

44
00:02:29.566 --> 00:02:33.000
You guessed it. Greninja evolved from my Frogadier.

45
00:02:36.366 --> 00:02:37.533
- Hm!
- Dier!

46
00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:39.200
I knew it!

47
00:02:39.266 --> 00:02:41.400
- Froakie.
- Gren.

48
00:02:41.466 --> 00:02:43.000
Pika.

49
00:02:43.066 --> 00:02:46.333
Sanpei, how was Greninja poisoned in the first place?

50
00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:49.600
- Yeah, what could've happened?
- Happened?

51
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:51.633
- Uh, well...
- There you are.

52
00:02:53.666 --> 00:02:56.466
Ninja Water Spout.

53
00:02:56.533 --> 00:02:58.100
What's that?

54
00:03:03.466 --> 00:03:05.533
Hey, what's going on?

55
00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.600
Barbaracle. The Collective Pokémon.

56
00:03:07.666 --> 00:03:10.433
Barbaracle's limbs can move independently of each other,

57
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.600
but they usually follow the head's commands.

58
00:03:12.666 --> 00:03:13.866
- There they are.
- Huh?

59
00:03:13.933 --> 00:03:16.400
- Those two are the ones who attacked us.
- Those two?

60
00:03:16.466 --> 00:03:20.333
Indeed. And very soon, the secret scroll will be mine.

61
00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.366
Barbaracle, Razor Shell.

62
00:03:22.433 --> 00:03:23.400
Bar!

63
00:03:23.466 --> 00:03:24.600
-Froakie.

64
00:03:24.666 --> 00:03:26.133
Baracle!

65
00:03:26.866 --> 00:03:28.800
Kie!

66
00:03:28.866 --> 00:03:31.566
Froakie!

67
00:03:31.633 --> 00:03:33.333
Froakie!

68
00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:37.066
No, Froakie. Quick, Pikachu. Use Thunderbolt, now.

69
00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:38.466
Pika!

70
00:03:38.533 --> 00:03:42.066
Pikachu!

71
00:03:42.133 --> 00:03:43.533
Baracle!

72
00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:47.633
- No way.
- But how? It looks fine.

73
00:03:49.966 --> 00:03:53.100
I never thought we'd witness a ninja Pokémon battle

74
00:03:53.166 --> 00:03:54.933
all the way out here in the wild.

75
00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.433
Any guess as to why they'd be doing such a thing?

76
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:02.200
Nah. Don't forget, catchin' Pikachu is all we're about and that's that.

77
00:04:02.266 --> 00:04:05.666
Right. And now is the perfect Pikachu-catching time,

78
00:04:05.733 --> 00:04:08.966
while their twerpish baby-brains are preoccupied.

79
00:04:09.033 --> 00:04:10.933
Wobba, wobba.

80
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.466
I have no idea what's going on, but it can't be good.

81
00:04:14.533 --> 00:04:16.433
- We need to get out of here.
- Mm-hm.

82
00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.933
All right. Ninja Leaf Shroud.

83
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.733
- Barbar?
- Ah.

84
00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:35.333
- Good thing we got out of there.
- Nenne-ne.

85
00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:39.033
- A masked ninja. Who was that guy?
- Pika.

86
00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:43.733
- Secret scroll? What did he mean?
- He meant this.

87
00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:48.100
This scroll must be delivered. And it has to be before sundown.

88
00:04:48.166 --> 00:04:51.966
- And that is my mission.
- Mission?

89
00:04:52.033 --> 00:04:57.300
Mm-hm. Saizo sent me. He's a master ninja and my trainer too.

90
00:04:57.366 --> 00:05:02.500
I will not let him down.

91
00:05:02.566 --> 00:05:06.266
Ninja techniques, passed down for generations in our village

92
00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:09.933
since ancient times, are contained in that secret scroll.

93
00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.233
I want you to take it to our fellow ninjas.

94
00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:15.400
Sanpei, what do you say? Will you do this?

95
00:05:15.466 --> 00:05:18.866
Yes. It would be my honour. I'm happy to go.

96
00:05:18.933 --> 00:05:19.900
Gren.

97
00:05:19.966 --> 00:05:24.066
This map will show you the manor where our comrades are located.

98
00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:26.966
- I'm counting on you.
- I'll do it. I promise.

99
00:05:27.033 --> 00:05:28.400
Ninja.

100
00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:35.833
So, Greninja and I set out on our important mission.

101
00:05:39.666 --> 00:05:41.233
But then...

102
00:05:46.233 --> 00:05:48.200
Ninja Dust Storm.

103
00:05:48.266 --> 00:05:50.433
- Wait, who are you?
- Gren.

104
00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:54.400
I am a ninja, just like you. Now give me the secret scroll.

105
00:05:54.466 --> 00:05:55.800
Barbaracle, appear.

106
00:05:57.466 --> 00:05:58.566
Baracle.

107
00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:02.366
Barbaracle, Razor Shell.

108
00:06:02.433 --> 00:06:04.666
Barbar!

109
00:06:04.733 --> 00:06:07.633
All right, Greninja, use Smokescreen.

110
00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.300
- Greninja!
- Cle!

111
00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:14.000
Ninja Wind Rush.

112
00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.666
Bar.

113
00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.166
- Quick Attack, let's go.
- Gren.

114
00:06:21.966 --> 00:06:24.400
Greninja!

115
00:06:24.466 --> 00:06:26.500
Push back. Then grab hold of it.

116
00:06:29.866 --> 00:06:31.500
Greninja!

117
00:06:31.566 --> 00:06:32.966
Poison Jab. Go!

118
00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:37.400
-Now, Razor Shell.

119
00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.000
Racle!

120
00:06:40.066 --> 00:06:41.533
Greninja.

121
00:06:48.133 --> 00:06:50.966
I have no idea who the masked ninja is.

122
00:06:51.033 --> 00:06:54.566
And why he's after the secret scroll, I don't know either.

123
00:06:55.866 --> 00:06:59.200
Now... it's getting late. I'd better be on my way.

124
00:06:59.266 --> 00:07:01.866
On your way? I wanna go with you.

125
00:07:01.933 --> 00:07:04.033
- Pikachu!
- Froa, froa.

126
00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:04.933
Gren.

127
00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.100
I appreciate the thought. But we were given the mission.

128
00:07:08.166 --> 00:07:11.033
- We can do this ourselves.
- What do you mean?

129
00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.033
- I can't leave my friend in danger.
- He's right.

130
00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.833
And there's strength in numbers, don't forget.

131
00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.966
- She's right too.
- Denne-ne-ne!

132
00:07:19.033 --> 00:07:21.866
- They're all right.
- You guys...

133
00:07:21.933 --> 00:07:23.166
OK, you can come.

134
00:07:23.233 --> 00:07:27.666
But, Ash, if things go wrong, promise me you'll take care of yourselves first.

135
00:07:27.733 --> 00:07:31.433
- Can you give me your word on that?
- Promise. All right, let's go.

136
00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.366
- Pika, pika!
- Hold on.

137
00:07:33.433 --> 00:07:34.433
Huh?

138
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:38.500
First things first. We need a plan to deal with that masked ninja.

139
00:07:38.566 --> 00:07:41.166
But what? Any idea what we should do?

140
00:07:41.233 --> 00:07:45.366
First, we need to distract and confuse Sanpei's pursuers.

141
00:07:45.433 --> 00:07:48.366
That's really important. Which means...

142
00:07:48.433 --> 00:07:51.166
the future is now, thanks to science.

143
00:07:51.233 --> 00:07:53.433
Clemontic Gear, on.

144
00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:58.500
Anticipating this situation, I proceeded to invent this very machine.

145
00:07:58.566 --> 00:08:01.500
I call it the Robo Step-by-Step.

146
00:08:01.566 --> 00:08:07.233
- Robo Step-by-Step?
- Hey. It sounds like a baby's toy.

147
00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:09.900
- Denne-ne!
- They wanna use ninja techniques, right?

148
00:08:09.966 --> 00:08:14.233
So we'll counter them using science. My Robo Step-by-Step.

149
00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.600
Power, on.

150
00:08:16.666 --> 00:08:19.300
Awesome. Whoa, science is so amazing.

151
00:08:19.366 --> 00:08:21.066
OK, off you go.

152
00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.033
- So why don't we get going too?
- You bet.

153
00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.300
Pika.

154
00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:32.733
Where... are... they? Argh!

155
00:08:32.799 --> 00:08:35.299
Those brats... I hate twerps!

156
00:08:35.366 --> 00:08:39.066
Come on! You never find a twerp when you need one!

157
00:08:39.133 --> 00:08:40.700
We will. And there's proof.

158
00:08:42.666 --> 00:08:46.266
I'd say those are twerpish footprints. They must be close by.

159
00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:47.833
- Wobba.
- Hm?

160
00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:49.833
Wob, wobba, wob.

161
00:08:52.900 --> 00:08:55.700
Prepare for trouble, I've seen enough!

162
00:08:55.766 --> 00:08:57.766
And make it double, we're quick and tough!

163
00:08:57.833 --> 00:08:59.966
Stop! You spoke too soon!

164
00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:03.133
You stop. We were just starting to get warmed up.

165
00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.066
Now look. We're getting cold.

166
00:09:05.133 --> 00:09:07.300
No, you're the dopes who didn't look.

167
00:09:07.366 --> 00:09:08.833
- Heads up.
- Hm?

168
00:09:10.333 --> 00:09:13.200
- Cheats!
- The nerve! We've been hoodwinked!

169
00:09:13.266 --> 00:09:14.966
Wobba! Wob!

170
00:09:16.266 --> 00:09:19.366
Of course. The science twerp did this.

171
00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:29.366
-For some reason, I'm not surprised.

172
00:09:29.433 --> 00:09:32.266
Wob, wob, Wobbuffet.

173
00:09:34.766 --> 00:09:39.500
This is where we are, and this is where the manor is. Hm.

174
00:09:39.566 --> 00:09:42.666
That means we'll have to wind around this way.

175
00:09:42.733 --> 00:09:46.700
But if we do that, there's no way we'll be able to get there

176
00:09:46.766 --> 00:09:48.100
before the sun goes down.

177
00:09:48.166 --> 00:09:51.166
And then, you won't deliver the secret scroll on time.

178
00:09:51.233 --> 00:09:53.000
- Now what?
- We could fly.

179
00:09:53.066 --> 00:09:55.666
Of course we don't know how. Right? Ne?

180
00:09:55.733 --> 00:09:59.566
- Are there any shortcuts?
- There's one, but... we can't.

181
00:09:59.633 --> 00:10:03.366
I'd worry about all of you. I don't wanna take the risk.

182
00:10:03.433 --> 00:10:07.433
Don't worry. We can handle it. No matter what.

183
00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.900
- Pika!
- Kie, kie.

184
00:10:08.966 --> 00:10:12.033
It'll be a breeze. Don't you think, Dedenne?

185
00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.200
Denne-ne-ne-ne!

186
00:10:13.266 --> 00:10:16.200
- OK. That's what we're gonna do.
- Agreed.

187
00:10:16.266 --> 00:10:19.933
Oh, Ash... All of you... Heh.

188
00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.566
All right. Then let's go.

189
00:10:21.633 --> 00:10:24.000
Yeah!

190
00:10:24.066 --> 00:10:26.666
Who's that Pokémon?

191
00:10:31.066 --> 00:10:33.133
It's Barbaracle.

192
00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:34.866
Baracle.

193
00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.266
Everyone. Be careful.

194
00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:46.100
Be really, really careful.

195
00:10:46.166 --> 00:10:50.133
- Remember, slow and steady wins the race.
- I know all that.

196
00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:52.033
But I'm worried about how you're doing.

197
00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:55.066
Who, me? I'm doing just fine.

198
00:10:57.233 --> 00:10:59.166
- Serena!
- Clemont.

199
00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.133
- Gren!
- Froakie!

200
00:11:06.833 --> 00:11:10.000
Aaah! Aaah! Aaah!

201
00:11:11.233 --> 00:11:14.733
- That was a close call.
- Hey. Are you guys doing all right?

202
00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:18.166
- Yeah, we're fine.
- Thanks to you two.

203
00:11:21.566 --> 00:11:24.633
Uh, more climbing?

204
00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.900
Denne-ne!

205
00:11:25.966 --> 00:11:27.166
Nope.

206
00:11:27.233 --> 00:11:30.400
No need to climb any more.

207
00:11:30.466 --> 00:11:32.766
Look. Over there.

208
00:11:32.833 --> 00:11:35.400
That cave is connected to the other side.

209
00:11:35.466 --> 00:11:39.133
- Awesome. Let's do it.
- Pika.

210
00:11:45.933 --> 00:11:49.100
I see. What a lucky break that the cave slopes down.

211
00:11:49.166 --> 00:11:53.100
And that means when we make it out, we're at the foot of the mountain.

212
00:11:55.433 --> 00:11:57.900
- Hey, what's that sound?
- Pika? Pika, pika!

213
00:12:02.366 --> 00:12:03.733
A group of Golbat.

214
00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:05.233
Golbat!

215
00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.600
Oh, no. What are they gonna do? Oh!

216
00:12:07.666 --> 00:12:11.000
We've wandered into their territory. They don't like that.

217
00:12:11.066 --> 00:12:13.633
- Golbat, knock it off.
- Pika, pika.

218
00:12:16.666 --> 00:12:20.600
No choice. Greninja. Smokescreen, let's go.

219
00:12:22.166 --> 00:12:24.533
Quick, now's our chance.

220
00:12:30.866 --> 00:12:32.966
- Pika...
- Froakie.

221
00:12:33.033 --> 00:12:34.933
- Gren.
- Huh?

222
00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:41.166
- Hey, look. The manor's over there.
- All right. Hey, guys.

223
00:12:42.966 --> 00:12:44.300
Barbar!

224
00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.133
What was that?

225
00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:53.300
- Barbar.
- Hand over the sacred scroll at once.

226
00:12:53.366 --> 00:12:55.566
We're not handing over anything.

227
00:12:55.633 --> 00:12:58.900
Hold on. Leave this to me and go find everyone else.

228
00:12:58.966 --> 00:13:01.366
- No. I'm not leaving you alone.
- Huh?

229
00:13:01.433 --> 00:13:04.433
We can win this battle if we do it as a team.

230
00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.600
Let's hurry up and beat them, then go and find the others.

231
00:13:07.666 --> 00:13:10.100
- Wow, Ash...
- Ninja.

232
00:13:10.166 --> 00:13:11.366
Hm.

233
00:13:16.166 --> 00:13:17.166
As you wish.

234
00:13:17.233 --> 00:13:19.133
Use Double Team.

235
00:13:23.933 --> 00:13:26.200
- Use Water Shuriken.
- Use Water Pulse.

236
00:13:26.333 --> 00:13:27.766
- Ninja.
- Kie.

237
00:13:27.833 --> 00:13:29.200
Dodge it, quick.

238
00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:35.866
Keep up the attack. Pikachu, Electro Ball.

239
00:13:35.933 --> 00:13:36.966
Pikachu!

240
00:13:37.033 --> 00:13:39.466
Block that with Razor Shell.

241
00:13:39.533 --> 00:13:41.400
Barcle!

242
00:13:45.233 --> 00:13:46.366
Pika, pika.

243
00:13:47.566 --> 00:13:50.166
Pika? Pika!

244
00:13:50.233 --> 00:13:51.966
- What was that?
- More enemies?

245
00:13:53.966 --> 00:13:56.100
Prepare for trouble, the enemies mount!

246
00:13:56.166 --> 00:13:58.366
And make it double, these enemies count!

247
00:13:58.433 --> 00:14:00.933
To protect our ninja reputation!

248
00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:03.533
Our throwing stars will rule the nation!

249
00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:06.666
Our code of the ninja will cut you no slack!

250
00:14:06.733 --> 00:14:10.233
We jump from the shadows, and then we attack!

251
00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:12.833
- Jessie!
- And James.

252
00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:15.666
Team Rocket is master, there can be no debate!

253
00:14:15.733 --> 00:14:18.633
Defeating all ninjas, thus sealing their fate!

254
00:14:18.700 --> 00:14:21.200
- Meowth, that's great!
- Wobbuffet!

255
00:14:23.233 --> 00:14:26.166
- Team Rocket. What do you want?
- Pikachu?

256
00:14:26.233 --> 00:14:29.000
If you have to ask, you're even dumber than you look.

257
00:14:29.066 --> 00:14:33.366
There's no rest for the delightfully wicked when it comes to catching Pikachu.

258
00:14:33.433 --> 00:14:35.333
Of course, that means you. Ha!

259
00:14:36.733 --> 00:14:38.300
Pika!

260
00:14:40.566 --> 00:14:42.200
- Huh?
- Grr!

261
00:14:42.266 --> 00:14:44.766
Out of the way, ninja brats.

262
00:14:44.833 --> 00:14:47.566
We want them, not you. Stay out of this.

263
00:14:47.633 --> 00:14:50.233
We want Pikachu.

264
00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:53.133
Take your silly scroll. What does that have to do with us?

265
00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.700
Now, Wobbuffet, teach them a lesson they won't forget.

266
00:14:55.766 --> 00:14:56.966
I want in too.

267
00:14:57.033 --> 00:14:59.633
- My Fury Swipes is gonna show you.
- Wobba, wobba!

268
00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:02.333
Block them with Razor Shell.

269
00:15:02.400 --> 00:15:04.566
Barcle!

270
00:15:04.633 --> 00:15:07.666
- Froakie, Water Pulse.
- Greninja, Water Shuriken.

271
00:15:07.733 --> 00:15:10.933
Froa! Greninja!

272
00:15:15.233 --> 00:15:18.433
We're blasting off again!

273
00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:20.400
Wobbuffet!

274
00:15:22.533 --> 00:15:24.566
Now, let's pick it up where we left off.

275
00:15:25.766 --> 00:15:29.566
- Wait. Why did you two help us out?
- My reasons are my own.

276
00:15:29.633 --> 00:15:32.566
- Barbaracle, Poison Jab.
- Bara!

277
00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:35.600
Dodge it!

278
00:15:35.733 --> 00:15:37.133
Cle, cle, cle!

279
00:15:37.833 --> 00:15:40.600
Froakie, Double Team! Froakie, kie, kie!

280
00:15:40.666 --> 00:15:44.066
Froakie, use Cut. Pikachu, Iron Tail.

281
00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.300
Pikachu!

282
00:15:45.366 --> 00:15:48.066
Barbaracle, Mud-Slap.

283
00:15:48.133 --> 00:15:52.133
Baracle!

284
00:15:55.766 --> 00:15:57.933
- Froakie!
- Pikachu...

285
00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.866
- Pikachu.
- Greninja.

286
00:15:59.933 --> 00:16:03.333
- You've got to be strong.
- I'd say this is over.

287
00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.133
Barbaracle, Poison Jab.

288
00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:09.766
Pika...

289
00:16:09.833 --> 00:16:12.966
- Barbar!
- Froa...

290
00:16:13.033 --> 00:16:14.400
Look out!

291
00:16:14.966 --> 00:16:17.466
- Froa...
- Rar!

292
00:16:17.533 --> 00:16:19.100
Froa!

293
00:16:19.166 --> 00:16:21.100
-Pika...

294
00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:32.433
- Bar!
- Oh!

295
00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:35.000
- That light...
- It's evolving.

296
00:16:35.066 --> 00:16:38.333
- Huh? Froakie's evolving?
- Froa!

297
00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:45.500
- Froakie. You just evolved.
- Frog.

298
00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:49.933
Frogadier. The Bubble Frog Pokémon,

299
00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.933
and the evolved form of Froakie.

300
00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.866
Frogadier's speed is unmatched.

301
00:16:53.933 --> 00:16:56.866
It can climb a tower over 2,000 feet tall in one minute.

302
00:16:56.933 --> 00:16:59.866
Awesome. It's also got brand-new moves.

303
00:16:59.933 --> 00:17:03.333
Even if Froakie did evolve, it's still no match for us.

304
00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:06.933
- Barbaracle, Razor Shell.
- Racle!

305
00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.466
- Now, Frogadier, use Cut.
- Frog!

306
00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:17.400
Their strength's the same. Frogadier's putting up an equal fight.

307
00:17:17.466 --> 00:17:20.900
- Watch this. Do it, Frogadier.
- Frogadier.

308
00:17:20.966 --> 00:17:23.466
Hm. Use Poison Jab.

309
00:17:24.466 --> 00:17:27.633
'Kay, Frogadier, use Aerial Ace.

310
00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:30.366
- Frogadier!
- Cle!

311
00:17:30.433 --> 00:17:35.100
- Frogadier!
- Barbar!

312
00:17:38.933 --> 00:17:40.366
Had enough?

313
00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:48.900
All right, then, time for Ninja Leaf Shroud.

314
00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:55.366
All right, now go to the manor.

315
00:17:55.433 --> 00:17:59.366
There, you will discover the whereabouts of your friends.

316
00:17:59.433 --> 00:18:04.166
- All right. Let's go to the manor.
- But wait. What if it's a trap?

317
00:18:04.233 --> 00:18:06.200
It just might be a trap.

318
00:18:06.266 --> 00:18:10.166
But that's all we have to work with. I say we have to go.

319
00:18:11.300 --> 00:18:13.133
I hear you.

320
00:18:18.333 --> 00:18:22.066
Excuse me. I, Sanpei, have arrived.

321
00:18:22.133 --> 00:18:24.333
- Pika!
- Hey, is anybody here?

322
00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:27.566
- I've come to deliver the secret scroll.
- Hello?

323
00:18:27.633 --> 00:18:29.666
Look over here.

324
00:18:29.733 --> 00:18:30.700
Denne-ne-ne-ne!

325
00:18:30.766 --> 00:18:32.366
- Hi, Ash.
- Hi, Sanpei.

326
00:18:32.433 --> 00:18:35.566
- Hey, guys. You all right?
- Welcome.

327
00:18:35.633 --> 00:18:37.133
-Pika?

328
00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:39.533
- Huh?

329
00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:44.700
I'm most impressed you made it all the way here.

330
00:18:44.766 --> 00:18:46.466
Well done, Sanpei.

331
00:18:46.533 --> 00:18:47.700
Huh?

332
00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.200
Saizo?

333
00:18:51.266 --> 00:18:53.633
Hey, what's going on?

334
00:18:55.966 --> 00:18:57.966
- Pika?
- There's nothing written on it.

335
00:18:58.033 --> 00:19:01.466
No way. Master, what is this all about?

336
00:19:01.533 --> 00:19:04.400
- I was testing you.
- Testing me?

337
00:19:04.466 --> 00:19:07.866
You are a ninja who went on a training journey.

338
00:19:07.933 --> 00:19:11.900
So I thought I should give you a test, to see just how much you've grown.

339
00:19:11.966 --> 00:19:15.266
Saizo didn't want to us to get in the middle of any trouble

340
00:19:15.333 --> 00:19:20.600
that might have put us in harm's way, so he brought us over here to the manor.

341
00:19:20.666 --> 00:19:24.766
Unfortunately, Ash, we weren't able to find you and Pikachu.

342
00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:31.366
Now I get it. You're all right. That's what really counts.

343
00:19:33.033 --> 00:19:37.233
Whether it's blank or not, I've delivered the secret scroll on time.

344
00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:40.366
- Which means our mission is now complete.
- Mm-hm.

345
00:19:40.433 --> 00:19:44.000
You made a heartfelt connection with your friends,

346
00:19:44.066 --> 00:19:47.333
and overcame formidable obstacles along with Greninja.

347
00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:50.066
And I saw it all with my very own eyes.

348
00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:56.833
I'll make a full report. Directly to the village elder.

349
00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:01.066
- Oh! That's great. Thank you so very much.
- Ninja.

350
00:20:01.133 --> 00:20:04.833
- A Frogadier! Is that who I think it is?
- Of course.

351
00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:07.000
Ash's Froakie must have evolved.

352
00:20:07.066 --> 00:20:11.900
Aw, I wanted to see that. I know. You can go back to being Froakie.

353
00:20:11.966 --> 00:20:15.200
- Then I can watch you evolve too.
- Dier.

354
00:20:15.266 --> 00:20:18.066
Bonnie? That's not really how it works.

355
00:20:18.133 --> 00:20:19.600
- Sanpei.
- Huh?

356
00:20:19.666 --> 00:20:23.100
Your mission is all done. So, what do you say?

357
00:20:24.033 --> 00:20:27.600
- You wanna have a battle?
- This time, I'll win.

358
00:20:27.666 --> 00:20:31.533
- We'll give it our all. Right, Frogadier?
- Frog.

359
00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:35.600
After a fierce battle against Saizo, the masked ninja,

360
00:20:35.666 --> 00:20:38.333
Froakie has evolved into Frogadier.

361
00:20:38.400 --> 00:20:41.033
Soon, our heroes will be off once again,

362
00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:44.733
as the journey to Coumarine City continues.
